  "description": "Our Beyond 1 is a drop bar, offroad adventure bike designed to take the rider wherever the compass guides them. The frame and fork are both made from reliable and lightweight 4130 double butted crmo tubing with a multitude of bottle and rack mounting options, joined to dropouts for thru-axles. Internal dynamo light cable routing also eliminates the possibility of snagging. Shifting is from Microshift and their new 2 x 10 Sword set mated with an 11 - 38T cassette and 40 / 28T chainset. Braking duties are handled by TRP Spyre C mechanical callipers. The WTB rims are tubeless-ready and both 27.5’’ (XS-S) and 29’’ sizes use the awesome all-condition WTB Ranger TCS tyres. All you need now is to choose a destination, pack up and head off.\n\nWeight frame: 2540 g frame (size M, incl. TA, bolts, seatclamp, hanger)",
